{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56816","headline":"四真人降魏夫人歌共五章（幷序） · 项宗","name":"四真人降魏夫人歌共五章（幷序）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"丹明焕上清，八风鼓太霞。\n廻我神霄辇，遂造玉岭阿。\n咄嗟天地外，九围皆吾家。\n上采日中精，下饮黄月华。\n灵观空无中，鹏路无间邪。\n顾见魏贤安，浊气伤尔和。\n勤研玄中思，道成更相过。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"项宗","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56816.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56816","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}